  ("to increased liking for a stimulus; in short, familiarity leads to" 0.51625 0.9314 0.3748 0.39109 0.39109 0.01629 0.00437 0.3336 0.0132 "Times-Roman" 0.0125 nil nil 0 "Times-Roman" nil)
